# Copy to sentry.properties for local ProGuard/R8 mapping uploads (optional).
# Runtime crash reporting uses the DSN baked into SentryBootstrap / manifests —
# this file is only for Gradle (org/project + mapping upload auth).
#
# === Mapping upload checklist (docs only — do not ship a release from agents) ===
# 1. Copy this file to sentry.properties (gitignored) OR set CI secret SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN.
# 2. Token scopes: project:releases, org:read (project:write for source context).
# 3. Release workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml) passes SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN into
#    the Gradle/Sentry plugin when maintainers deliberately cut a GitHub Release.
# 4. Verify after a real maintainer release: Sentry → Releases → mapping uploaded
#    for the versionName / versionCode that shipped.
# 5. Never commit auth.token. Prefer the CI secret over a local token.
defaults.org=betterstreamflix
defaults.project=betterstreamflix

# Org auth token from https://sentry.io/settings/account/api/auth-tokens/
# auth.token=sntrys_YOUR_ORG_AUTH_TOKEN
